### Health
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### 1. Upload a text document (recursive chunking)
# @name uploadText
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=DemoBoundary

--DemoBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="policy.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Refunds are processed within 14 days of a returned item being received.
Customers can request a refund by contacting support with their order number.

Interview bookings are available on weekdays between 09:00 and 18:00.
--DemoBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="chunking_strategy"

recursive
--DemoBoundary--

###

@documentId = {{uploadText.response.body.id}}

### 2. Upload a text document (semantic chunking)
# @name uploadSemantic
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=DemoBoundary

--DemoBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="policy.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Refunds are processed within 14 days of a returned item being received.
Customers can request a refund by contacting support with their order number.

Interview bookings are available on weekdays between 09:00 and 18:00.
--DemoBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="chunking_strategy"

semantic
--DemoBoundary--

###

@semanticDocumentId = {{uploadSemantic.response.body.id}}

### 3. Read one document
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}

### 4. List documents with pagination
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/documents?limit=5&offset=0

### 5. Ask a question
# @name firstQuestion
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "How long do refunds take?",
  "document_id": "{{documentId}}"
}

###

@sessionId = {{firstQuestion.response.body.session_id}}

### 6. Ask a follow-up in the same session
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "{{sessionId}}",
  "message": "And what about the cost?",
  "document_id": "{{documentId}}"
}

### 7. Read the session history
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/chat/{{sessionId}}/history

### 8. Start a booking
# @name startBooking
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "I want to book an interview"
}

###

@bookingSession = {{startBooking.response.body.session_id}}

### 9. Give name and email
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "{{bookingSession}}",
  "message": "My name is Ana Demo and my email is ana.demo@example.com"
}

### 10. Give the date and time (must be today or later, 15 Nov 2026 or after)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "{{bookingSession}}",
  "message": "On 2026-11-20 at 10:00"
}

### 11. Confirm the booking
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "{{bookingSession}}",
  "message": "yes"
}

### 12. List bookings
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/bookings?limit=5&offset=0

### 13. Clear the chat session
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/v1/chat/{{sessionId}}

### 14. Delete both documents
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}

###

DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/v1/documents/{{semanticDocumentId}}

### 15. Error: unsupported file type (expect 415)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=DemoBoundary

--DemoBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="photo.png"
Content-Type: image/png

not really a png
--DemoBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="chunking_strategy"

recursive
--DemoBoundary--

### 16. Error: unknown document (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/documents/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000